OL,3,GNEWSAMurder investigation after woman's
OL,4,Abody found
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man in his 40s was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of murder and taken to King's
OL,8,FLynn Police Investigation Centre for
OL,9,Fquestioning. He remains in custody, and
OL,10,Fa superintendent's extension was
OL,11,Fgranted to allow an additional 12 hours
OL,12,Ffor further investigation and
OL,13,Fquestioning.
OL,15,FA cordon is in place at the property,
OL,16,Fand a Home Office post-mortem
OL,17,Fexamination was due to be carried out
OL,18,Fon Monday.
